intuition:
Imagine dropping a handful of marbles on the floor. Normal: most land near the center, few at edges – a mountain shape.

{{viz:dist-normal}}

Right skewed: most marbles clump on the left, a few roll far right.

{{viz:dist-right-skewed}}

Left skewed: the mirror image, tail pointing left.

{{viz:dist-left-skewed}}

Uniform: marbles spread evenly – like someone placed them in a grid.

{{viz:dist-uniform}}

Bimodal: two separate piles – maybe marbles from two different tables.

{{viz:dist-bimodal}}
